{
    "extends": "qwen35_0p8b_300m_model_sceneplan_44_sao.json",
    "_task": "Pre-fullscale P10 candidate: source-local semantic attention, monotonic formal-speech duration supervision, and a low-weight clean-latent sound temporal-difference auxiliary.",
    "_stage": "Blocked from full training until the speech, sound, joint-heldout, leakage, throughput, and resume gates all pass.",
    "_note": "The base RF MSE, semantic Qwen cross-attention, direct 4+4 local controls, and independent 15% raw CFG remain unchanged. Forced alignment is an offline training teacher only. The rejected target-transient MSE reweighting is disabled.",
